(2) Any act done, scheme carried out or proposal made, whether by one person alone or by 2 (two) or more persons together.

(d) For the purpose of this Article, "tax benefit" means:

(1) A reduction in the amount payable as GST;

(2) An increase in the amount of input tax that may be offset against output tax;

(3) GST paid becoming refundable, or an increase in the amount refundable, or the circumstance of receiving a refund being brought forward;

(4) The date on which GST is payable being postponed;

(5) Being able to deduct input tax in a taxable period earlier than the taxable period in which the opportunity to deduct input tax should arise;

(6) Any gain obtained as a result of the date on which GST is payable being postponed, or of being able to deduct input tax in a taxable period earlier than the taxable period in which the opportunity to deduct input tax should arise,

